{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "770facf36f07a391c6b6e29e7d9ae51f8220b2adfbe426a1864258429578063e", "ja": "（アイドル達のパジャマグラビア撮影が終わった。\n莉緒の姿が見えないが、どこに行ったんだろう……）", "zh": "（偶像们的睡衣写真摄影结束了。\n但却没看到莉绪，她跑到哪去了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f493772189ebe749a961e6d44b50a76e6371417673ff7aabb06538847d1195e7", "ja": "莉緒、ここにいたのか。\n……溜め息なんかついて、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "莉绪，你在这里啊。\n……你怎么在叹气？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "28e49dda838649c7158cd14170b142ab5a71150d44c4cffdcfd8ff374906a1ce", "ja": "きゃっ！　{$P$}くん、もう！\nビックリさせないで！", "zh": "哇！{$P$}，真是的！\n别吓我啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c36fda9f2f5718d5a5e7ac3c95e79cf2d5d7914cd5c13813432e37ed64a1b2e1", "ja": "ご、ごめん。驚かせたのは悪かったけど、\nそれより何かあったのか？", "zh": "抱、抱歉，吓到你了。\n但你究竟怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "17918b813156466d0a8b2369b56469d64a864c979981ecdf58a80a17097fa75d", "ja": "あ、ううん！　大丈夫、大したことじゃないの。\nただちょっと、やりすぎちゃったかしら？って……。", "zh": "啊，没什么！我没事的，没什么大不了。\n只是觉得尺度会不会有点太过火了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1006_p", "source_sha256": "99270b1a80326f0a6ce54eac5d77fda0065763de05372830faa41b965914c7f3", "ja": "やりすぎって、グラビア撮影のことか？", "zh": "太过火？你是指写真摄影吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "509142ef2bb82156f1a8e6e89eb77f94946e5fb2ddf3df12c27b6a2c564c3e8d", "ja": "ええ、そうよ。パジャマだし、大丈夫かなって\n思ったんだけど……大胆すぎたかしら？って。", "zh": "嗯嗯，对啊。我本来觉得穿睡衣应该没问题吧……\n但拍完又觉得是不是太大胆了点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "f40c6d99930e2bc15f82d1fe01bcf1098aca7d3768c3d3d8fdd59d19fbacc118", "ja": "それに私ったら、気分が盛り上がっちゃって。\nそのあと、{$P$}くんに……。", "zh": "而且我居然一时冲昏了头，\n拍完后还让{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "315bb784703f235bbc76fea4a07aa3eae36fe9b956f02bc2d324959932154ba7", "ja": "ねぇ、{$P$}くん……\n私のこと、あきれてない？", "zh": "{$P$}，我问你喔……\n你有没有对我很失望？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1010_p", "source_sha256": "34130b0c889934ba4be902564489ea12aa2cc5207c4bdb81c7def2accdab56b7", "ja": "あきれてはいないけど……そうだな。俺はあの時、\n莉緒をもっと大切にしないといけない、と思ったよ。", "zh": "是没有到失望……只是，我那时候觉得，\n应该要更加珍惜莉绪才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "bdf1c3c4bde1d02eb45f479c79ae9d80641d0f97064f182fe44fca470a6a0e4a", "ja": "えっ？　……や、やだ、{$P$}くん。\nどうしたの？　そんな急に……。", "zh": "咦……讨、讨厌，{$P$}。\n你怎么了？突然说这种话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1e82d68586533d7700e43321db5029e0c0f1796803a8d9e5d29f279d149e45d8", "ja": "急も何も、当然だよ。アイドルの健康管理も、\nプロデューサーの仕事のうちだからな。", "zh": "怎么会突然呢？这是当然的啊，为偶像做好健康管理，\n本来就是制作人的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1013_p", "source_sha256": "abd04025a32780ab243ef048c064651d43223907138e4196dade5973e4b364d9", "ja": "莉緒も、切羽詰まって俺にマッサージを頼む前に、\n自分でもよくストレッチをしておくんだぞ？", "zh": "莉绪，你自己也该事先拉拉筋，\n免得下次又走投无路才找我帮忙按摩喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "cea51d61e824ce2ffbfd61157272534b98c455371aed4be3a9af5d609f4b9877", "ja": "も……もう！\nそうなんだけど、そういうことじゃないのよ～！", "zh": "真……真是的！\n你说得没错，但我想的不是这样啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0053_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "2fb27a59fe6e8b0bb4f90380cad9037fd01b07fe7cbe8303e5f2507f4b0ea78e", "ja": "{$P$}くんの、バカ……！", "zh": "{$P$}，你这笨蛋……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
